export const METHOD = "Replay of the 4,826 same-day orders received after the 08:00 pick-list cutoff. An order added to today's pick list loses the same-day-after-cutoff cause and takes the observed on-time rate of deliveries with its remaining causes (the What-if simulator's combo method). SLA money = that gain x the client's expected SLA penalty per late delivery (its penalties / its late deliveries). Orders with an incomplete address are on hold and never added. Yearly = six months of data x2.";

export const ASSUMPTIONS: string[] = ["The grace period figures are exact for the history: every complete same-day order in it is added.","History has no email text, so the urgent window is an upper bound: it counts priority-client orders as if every one said it was urgent. Other clients' orders need a valid reason, which history cannot show, so they are counted but not added.","Added orders ship the same day like the 08:00 pick list; the warehouse adds them to today's list.","Order counts are for the six months of data; money and late deliveries avoided are per year."];
